{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2022-02-28 13:30:00', 'title': 'LINDE PLC: LINDE ANNOUNCES DIVIDEND INCREASE FOR 2022 AND NEW $10 BILLION SHARE REPURCHASE PROGRAM', 'text': "GUILDFORD, UK / ACCESSWIRE / FEBRUARY 28, 2022 / LINDE PLC (NYSE:LIN)(FWB:LIN) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.17 PER SHARE, REFLECTING A 10% INCREASE OVER THE PREVIOUS QUARTER'S DIVIDEND. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON MARCH 25, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON MARCH 11, 2022."}